// size_number's my_strtoll10 accepts leading spaces/tabs and an optional sign
// in quoted identifiers; negative zero still converts to zero. A bare unit
// also passes the parser action (it does not check the no-conversion error).
// Preserve those parse-time spellings; storage-engine validation is separate.
